{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/swift\/never\/defaultsize(_:)"]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"defaultSize","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Size","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4SizeV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE11defaultSizeyQrAA0F0VF::SYNTHESIZED::s:s5NeverO","title":"defaultSize(_:)","extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"defaultSize"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"size"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4SizeV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Size","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Size"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Scene","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene"},{"kind":"text","text":"\n"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"size","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The default size for new windows created from a scene.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene that uses a default size for new windows."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this scene modifier to indicate a default initial size for a new","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"window that the system creates from a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" declaration. For","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"example, you can request that new windows that a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"generates occupy 600 points in the x-dimension and 400 points in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the y-dimension:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["@main","struct MyApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            ContentView()","        }","        .defaultSize(CGSize(width: 600, height: 400))","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The size that you specify acts only as a default for when the window","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"first appears. People can later resize the window using interface","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"controls that the system provides. Also, during state restoration,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the system restores windows to their most recent size rather than","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the default size.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you specify a default size that’s outside the range of the window’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"inherent resizability in one or both dimensions, the system clamps the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"affected dimension to keep it in range. You can configure the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"resizability of a scene using the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene\/windowResizability(_:)","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"modifier.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The default size modifier affects any scene type that creates windows","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in macOS, namely:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Window"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DocumentGroup"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Settings"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you want to specify the input directly in terms of width and height,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"code":"Scene\/defaultSize(width:height:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" instead."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Swift","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Swift\/Never"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets a default size for a window."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Swift\/Never\/defaultSize(_:)"},"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Scene/windowResizability(_:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"windowResizability","kind":"identifi